{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/不朽战骸","pageid":6656,"revid":18807,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E6%88%98%E9%AA%B8&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E6%88%98%E9%AA%B8&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E6%88%98%E9%AA%B8&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>不朽战骸</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E4.B8.8D.E6.9C.BD.E6.88.98.E9.AA.B8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"不朽战骸\"><b>不朽战骸</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 不朽战骸.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/lga56z4oc8wy22jyn1tmajpk0a4hgye.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E6%88%98%E9%AA%B8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/lga56z4oc8wy22jyn1tmajpk0a4hgye.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E6%88%98%E9%AA%B8.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/ec/lga56z4oc8wy22jyn1tmajpk0a4hgye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />不朽战骸\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）被击败或离场时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>物理范围伤害，攻击前施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼物防1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼物防1</font></span></span>]、<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"粉碎枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">粉碎枷锁</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；并对范围内友方召唤物造成生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，使其获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"战争杀器\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">战争杀器</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合。<br />✦若范围内没有敌人，则使[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">基安希尔</span>]获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">基安希尔</span>]被击败时，立即触发本技能并随后[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">离场</font></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164125\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.468 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.626 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9806/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 158961/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12880/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  609.794      1 模板:简单技能\n100.00%  609.794      1 -total\n 12.09%   73.704      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 11.27%   68.701      8 模板:中括号介绍\n  1.57%    9.545      1 模板:面包屑\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:6656-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164124 and revision id 18807. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"技能","missing":true}],"images":["技能_不朽战骸.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>不朽战骸</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromt